  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "S3_INTRO",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_intro-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "小琛，我快到学校了。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_intro-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "你那边还没处理好吗？"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_CHOICE_1",
      "legacyMessages": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_CHOICE_1",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_1-a",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_1-reply-a",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "姐，你是不是早就知道那本书的事？为什么一直催我把钱结清？",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_1A",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_1-b",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_1-reply-b",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "姐，我查到了一些四年前的事。尧哥当年回C市，真的只是去处理家事吗？",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_1B",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_1-c",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_1-reply-c",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我现在脑子很乱。四年前的6月25日到底发生了什么？我想听你亲口说。",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_1C",
          "disabled": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_1A",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "那本书？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-03",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "《道教命籍与民间禳解文化研究》……我查过了，确实是尧哥四年前借的。可现在，借阅责任却落到了我身上。这是不是和寄岁有关？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "这个我真的不知道。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-04",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "姐，我本来不想怀疑你。可你今天一直催我结清这笔钱，实在有些反常。你是不是有事瞒着我？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-06",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-07",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "是。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_1",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1a-05",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "你是不是知道他在找什么？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_1B",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "怎么突然问起这个？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-02",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我看到了他在旧书店的聊天记录。他当时一直在找一本叫《续算杂录》的书。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-03",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "四年前那段日子太痛苦了。我重病住院，尧哥又突然去世……后来，我一直不敢仔细回想。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-06",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可现在按时间来看，他是在旧书店找到《续算杂录》相关抄本之后，才动身回C市的。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-v21-05",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "姐，你是不是知道他为什么回去？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-04",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "没想到你会查到这些。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_1",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-07",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1b-08",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "是。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_1C",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "小琛，为什么突然问这些？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-02",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我查了2021年的病历，也看了尧哥以前和旧书店的消息。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-03",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我的出院记录里写着，我从6月25日开始好转。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-04",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可尧哥偏偏也是那天去世的。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-05",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "以前我不敢想，现在却没办法再告诉自己，这只是个巧合。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-06",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_1c-07",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "那个时间，确实不是巧合。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_1",
      "legacyMessages": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_COMMON_1",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "小琛，有些事我一直不知道该怎么开口。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "那年你住院以后，情况越来越不好。我签病危通知书时，医生已经让我们做好最坏的打算，说你可能熬不过那个月底。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我那时候真的很害怕，罗尧也一样。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-05",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "所以……你们当时想到了寄岁？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-06",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-04",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "起初他只是偶然找到了一些线索，或许能让你撑过这一关。后来他告诉我，旧书里记着一种叫“寄岁补年”的秘术，可以把别人的一段年岁暂时寄给你，让你继续活下去。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-10",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "但寄给我的，不是尧哥的年岁，对吗？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-07",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "是我的。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-08",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我把自己的年岁寄给了你。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-09",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "那时候我只想先让你活下来。至于以后会怎么样，我根本顾不上想。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-11",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可是寄来的年岁总会用完。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-12",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "对。寄来的年岁终究有尽头。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-13",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "他说，他还在找另一种办法。如果能找到，也许就不只是让你多活几年，而是能让你真正继续走下去。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-14",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "所以寄岁之后，还有借命。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-15",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "小尧没有把具体的方法告诉我。他只说，那和寄岁不是一回事。如果真的要做，他可能得付出自己的余生。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-16",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "你当时就知道了？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-17",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我知道有这个可能。我劝过他，可他那时候已经下定决心了。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_1-v21-18",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "后来他回了C市，说要去见一些从前认识的人。再之后，你的情况开始好转，他却在山洪里出了事，再也没回来。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_CHOICE_2",
      "legacyMessages": []
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_CHOICE_2",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_2-a",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_2-reply-a",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "所以，他根本不是普通的因为山洪意外去世。",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_2A",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_2-b",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_2-reply-b",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "……",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_2B",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_2-c",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_2-reply-c",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "等等。那尧哥后来又做了什么？",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_2C",
          "disabled": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_2A",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2a-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "山里出事的消息是真的。我只是一直没有告诉你，他为什么偏偏要在那时候回去。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2a-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我也没能见到小尧最后一面。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_2",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2a-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "那时候我只想先让你活下来。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2a-04",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "至于以后会怎么样，我根本顾不上想。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_2B",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_2",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2b-01",
