          "text": "对。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2b-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "寄来的年岁终究是有尽头的。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2b-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我当时也问过罗尧，之后该怎么办。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2b-04",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "他说他还在找另一种方法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_2C",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_2",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2c-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "他后来找到了另一种法子。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2c-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我记得他叫它「易命」。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_2c-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "他说，那或许能让你不只是多活几年，而是真正继续走下去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_COMMON_2",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "对不起，小琛。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_CHOICE_3",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-01",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "所以寄岁之后，还有易命？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "他跟我说过，那种方法和寄岁不一样。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-04",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "如果真的要做，他可能得付出自己的余生。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-05",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-06",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "你当时知道？"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-07",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我知道有这个可能。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-08",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我劝过他。可他那时候已经决定了。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-09",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "后来他回了C市，去见从前认识的人。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-10",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "再之后，你的情况开始好转。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_common_2-11",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "他却没有回来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_CHOICE_3",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_3-a",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_3-reply-a",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "所以我现在能活着，是因为他。你为什么一直不告诉我？",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_3A",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_3-b",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_3-reply-b",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "……",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_3B",
          "disabled": false
        },
        {
          "id": "s3_choice_3-c",
          "messageId": "s3_choice_3-reply-c",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "你为什么一直不告诉我？",
          "nextNodeId": "S3_BRANCH_3C",
          "disabled": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_3A",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3a-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "那时你才刚出院，身体还没恢复。我不知道你能不能承受这些，也不敢再拿你冒险。何况小尧已经……"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3a-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "后来拖得越久，就越不知道该从哪里说起了。"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_3",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3a-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我也没见到他最后一面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_3B",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_3",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3b-01",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "我没有办法向你证明那种法子真的存在。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3b-02",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "可我知道他为了你去做了什么。"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3b-03",
          "speakerId": "linyuan",
          "text": "还有那天以后发生的事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S3_BRANCH_3C",
      "type": "messages",
      "messages": [],
      "nextNodeId": "S3_COMMON_3",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "s3_branch_3c-01",
